    "title": "Specification Sheet: Python 3.13 Free-Threaded Build",
    "body": "Document reference: OFFICIAL-PRIMARY-2025-05-22. Effective: 2025-05-22. This specification sheet, issued by Meridian Labs, documents a significant development in Python's execution model. The core record is as follows: Python 3.13 offers an experimental free-threaded build without the GIL. The value as written: yes. This build, intended for evaluation and testing, allows multiple threads to run concurrently without the global interpreter lock. It aims to improve performance on multi-core systems for CPU-bound workloads. Meridian Labs notes this is an experimental feature, subject to change. Developers are encouraged to test compatibility with existing codebases. Further details and benchmarks are available in the accompanying technical report. This document supersedes any prior preliminary notes."
